  unitName: Maiden Vanila
  unitId: 850003
  unitNumber: 8012
  description: Besides being an orphan and raised to become an elite Mech pilot,
    little is known about Vanila. Some say she is the first Battle Maiden, a paladin
    from another world; others say she is more akin to ghosts, her soul broken and
    shared by a darker twin. However, she refused to speak of these, seeking solace
    from battle within the desolated clouds above.
  summonDesc: My heart is restless. <br>Grant me the freedom of the sky <br>and I
    will fight for you.
  fusionDesc: What is this..? <br>It feels like fragments <br>of my soul reuniting..
